> wcs@cbnewsh.HP.COM writes:
>Now that I've got NH 3.0 Patchlevel 6 working on my 3B2, I notice
>that sometimes my characters will step on things but not pick them
>up automatically.  Is this a feature?  It doesn't seem to be related
>to blessed/cursed, since sometimes it happens to gold.

It took me a long time to figure this out, too.  Patch level 6 seems to
have changed the algorithm for pickup.  With pickup set to ON, you will
pick up anything you move onto with a single-space move (hjklyubn keys),
but nothing you move onto with a multi-space move (HJKLYUBN).

I find the old pickup algorithm preferable, personally:  when I use HJKL to
move across the room to get the gold, now I have to hit ',' to pick it up -
an extra keystroke.

Anybody know the rationale for the change?

